@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam participantBorderColor #27AE60
skinparam participantFontColor #27AE60
skinparam participantFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #27AE60
skinparam sequenceActorFontColor #27AE60
skinparam arrowColor #555555
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #27AE60
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #EAFAF1
skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #27AE60
skinparam sequenceBoxFontColor #27AE60
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #EAFAF1
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #EAFAF1
skinparam noteBorderColor #27AE60

title **Nurse Onboarding & Verification** — Sequence Diagram

actor "Nurse\n(ممرض / ممرضة)" as NUR
participant "Nurse App" as NAPP
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "User\nService" as USR
participant "Document\nService" as DOC
participant "Notification\nService" as NOT
actor "Admin" as ADM
participant "Admin Panel" as ADMP

== Registration ==

NUR -> NAPP: Open app & tap Register
NAPP -> NAPP: Show registration form
NUR -> NAPP: Enter phone number

NAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/auth/otp/send
GW -> USR: Send OTP

USR -> USR: Generate 6-digit OTP
USR -> USR: Store with expiry (5 min)
USR -> NOT: Send SMS with OTP
NOT --> NAPP: OTP delivered via SMS

NUR -> NAPP: Enter OTP code
NAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/auth/otp/verify
GW -> USR: Verify OTP
USR -> USR: Validate OTP + check expiry

alt OTP Valid
  USR -> USR: Create User (type = NURSE)
  USR -> USR: Create Nurse profile (status: INCOMPLETE)
  USR --> GW: JWT access + refresh tokens
  GW --> NAPP: Tokens + profile
  NAPP --> NUR: Registration successful — proceed to documents
else OTP Invalid
  USR --> GW: Error: Invalid/expired OTP
  GW --> NAPP: Show error
  NAPP --> NUR: "Code incorrect, please try again"
end

== Document Upload ==

note right #EAFAF1
  Required documents:
  1. National ID (صورة البطاقة)
  2. Nursing License (ترخيص تمريض)
  3. Profile Photo (صورة شخصية)
end note

NUR -> NAPP: Upload National ID photo
NAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/nurse/documents
GW -> DOC: Upload and store document
DOC -> DOC: Validate file type & size (< 10MB)
DOC -> DOC: Store in S3/Minio
DOC --> GW: Document URL
GW --> NAPP: Document uploaded (status: PENDING)

NUR -> NAPP: Upload Nursing License photo
NAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/nurse/documents
GW -> DOC: Same upload flow
DOC --> GW: Document stored
GW --> NAPP: Document uploaded (status: PENDING)

NUR -> NAPP: Upload Profile Photo
NAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/nurse/documents
GW -> DOC: Same upload flow
DOC --> GW: Document stored
GW --> NAPP: Document uploaded (status: PENDING)

== Profile Completion ==

NUR -> NAPP: Fill profile details
NAPP -> NAPP: Name, gender, bio, experience, specializations
NUR -> NAPP: Submit profile

NAPP -> GW: PUT /api/v1/nurse/profile
GW -> USR: Update nurse profile
USR -> USR: Set verification_status = PENDING
USR -> USR: Activate nurse (limited — cannot go online)
USR --> GW: Profile updated
GW --> NAPP: "Documents submitted for review"

NAPP --> NUR: "Your application is being reviewed (SLA: 72 hours)"

== Admin Notification ==

USR -> NOT: Alert admin — new nurse pending verification
NOT -> ADMP: Push + In-app notification
ADMP --> ADM: "New nurse verification pending"

== Verification Review ==

note right #EAFAF1
  SLA: 72 hours (3 business days)
  48-hour nudge alert to admin
end note

ADM -> ADMP: Log in to Admin Panel
ADMP -> ADMP: View pending verifications queue
ADM -> ADMP: Select nurse application
ADMP -> ADMP: Display all uploaded documents side-by-side

ADM -> ADMP: Review National ID
ADM -> ADMP: Review Nursing License
note right #EAFAF1
  Admin checks:
  - License validity & expiry
  - Name matches National ID
  - Photo matches applicant
  - License number legitimacy
end note

alt Approve
  ADM -> ADMP: Tap "Approve"
  ADMP -> GW: POST /api/v1/admin/nurses/{id}/verify
  GW -> USR: Approve nurse

  USR -> USR: Set verification_status = APPROVED
  USR -> USR: Set verified_at = now
  USR -> USR: Store license_expiry_date
  USR -> USR: Mark nurse as ready to go online
  USR -> NOT: Push "Verification Approved"
  NOT --> NAPP: "Congratulations! You are now verified ✓"
  NAPP --> NUR: "Your account is now active. You can go online!"

  USR -> USR: Log audit: Nurse approved by {admin_id}

else Reject
  ADM -> ADMP: Tap "Reject"
  ADMP -> ADMP: Enter rejection reason (required)
  ADMP -> GW: POST /api/v1/admin/nurses/{id}/verify
  GW -> USR: Reject nurse

  USR -> USR: Set verification_status = REJECTED
  USR -> USR: Store rejection_reason
  USR -> NOT: Push "Verification Rejected"
  NOT --> NAPP: "Your application was not approved: {reason}"
  NAPP --> NUR: "Please correct and re-submit documents"

  USR -> USR: Log audit: Nurse rejected by {admin_id}
end

== Post-Verification (License Expiry Monitoring) ==

note right #EAFAF1
  License expiry tracking
  - 30 days before: warning notification
  - 7 days before: urgent warning
  - On expiry date: auto-set offline
  - Nurse must re-upload renewed license
end note

group License Expiry Watchdog
  USR -> USR: Daily cron: check license_expiry_date
  USR -> USR: If expiry in 30 days → send warning
  USR -> NOT: Push "License expires in 30 days"
  NOT --> NAPP: Show warning

  USR -> USR: If expiry in 7 days → send urgent warning
  USR -> NOT: Push "License expires in 7 days — renew now"
  NOT --> NAPP: Show urgent warning

  USR -> USR: If expiry date reached
  USR -> USR: Set is_online = false
  USR -> USR: Block nurse from toggling online
  USR -> NOT: Push "License expired — account deactivated"
  NOT --> NAPP: "Your license has expired. Upload renewed license."
end

== Re-Verification Cycle ==

NUR -> NAPP: Upload renewed license document
NAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/nurse/documents
GW -> DOC: Store new document
DOC --> GW: Document stored
GW -> USR: Flag for admin re-review
USR -> NOT: Alert admin
NOT --> ADMP: "Nurse re-uploaded license for review"
ADM -> ADMP: Review and approve (same flow as above)

@enduml
